  "description": "This package for F# developers contains types and modules which allow developers to quickly create and manipulate sequences of digits.\n    All of the sequences generated by the functions in this package are standard F# sequences, and all of the internal processing is done exclusively \n    with standard F# sequences, so they give you all of the benefits of, and follow the same rules as, standard F# sequences.\n    See the README in the the project website in GitHub for more information. Some functions create other types of collection.",
